# === Build artifacts ===
DerivedData/
.build/
build/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/
.swiftpm/
Package.pins
Packages/*/.build/

# Phase 5 Plan 05-04: CortexDecoderBench output (DEC-11). The latency_histogram.{json,png} +
# bins CSV are gitignored run artifacts; the committed evidence is the NUMBER + device annotation
# + reproduce command in 05-latency-evidence.md (Phase-4 gitignored-artifact discipline).
Packages/CortexDecoder/.bench/

# Phase 7 Plan 07-03: CortexReFITBench output (REFIT-03 / SC#3). The bench writes refit_bps.json
# here as a run artifact; the COMMITTED evidence is .planning/.../refit_bps.json + 07-bps-evidence.md
# (regenerated by re-running the bench --smoke; same gitignored-artifact discipline).
Packages/CortexReFIT/.bench/

# Phase 8 Plan 08-03: CortexDemoBench output (PERF-04 / D-07). The bench writes glass_to_glass.json
# here as a run artifact; the latency NUMBER is clock-dependent (real measured pipeline cost), so the
# committed evidence is the methodology + reproduce command, not a byte-pinned JSON (the structural
# fields — label, device, budget, passed — are stable; the ns values vary). Same gitignored-artifact
# discipline as the sibling benches.
Packages/CortexDemo/.bench/

# === XcodeGen output (regenerated; never committed) ===
Cortex.xcodeproj/
Cortex.xcworkspace/

# === Rust / CortexRing build artifacts (Phase 3) ===
# Built artifacts are regenerated by Tools/scripts/build-rust.sh (the `make bootstrap` analogue).
# The cbindgen-generated C header (Packages/CortexRing/rust/include/cortex_ring.h) IS committed and
# CI drift-gated (D-13); the xcframework and cargo target dir are rebuilt, never committed.
Packages/CortexRing/rust/target/
Packages/CortexRing/CortexRingFFI.xcframework/

# === Apple platform / Xcode noise ===
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# === Code-signing material (NEVER commit; protects against accidental leak per Phase 1 threat model) ===
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
fastlane/Matchfile.local
fastlane/.env
fastlane/report.xml
# Phase 8 (DIST-02, T-08-04-01): the REAL App Store Connect API key JSON is NEVER committed --
# only fastlane/asc_api_key.json.example (placeholders) is tracked. The .p8 itself is covered by
# the *.p8 rule above. Negation keeps the .example committable even if a broader glob is added.
fastlane/asc_api_key.json
!fastlane/asc_api_key.json.example

# === Coverage / profiling ===
*.profraw
*.profdata
*.gcda
*.gcno

